    <h2 class="entry-title entry-title--large p-name" data-content-field="title"><time class="dt-published date-highlight" datetime="2022-09-18" pubdate>Sep 18 </time>Screw Your Courage: a new novella</h2>

    <div class="meta-wrapper">
      <div class="blog-meta-item blog-meta-author"><a href="/blog?author=54076dc2e4b035477def3a3c" class="blog-author-name">Alexandra Caluen</a> </div><!--

      -->
    </div>
