          <div class="mask mask--left" id="maskLeft"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="blog-item-content e-content"><div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-layout-label="Post Body" data-type="item" data-updated-on="1663535801420" id="item-632784fd6aef862424724701"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-1c4e9b7a79f1bce4ddde"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">I frequently write about people at career turning points, and this particular M/M novella hinges on one character’s decision to challenge workplace discrimination. Click the image below for product link!</p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/f94ddcd6-e10d-402e-9c19-0df12e22290a_291/website.components.imageLayout.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/f94ddcd6-e10d-402e-9c19-0df12e22290a_291/website.components.imageLayout.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.imageLayout" data-sqsp-block="image-classic" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1663533854998_28285" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1663533854998_28285"><div class="sqs-block-content">

























  
  
    
